<title>GERMANY: German inland gas oil dips with poor buying.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil dips with poor buying.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.6552)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p>HAMBURG	     34.80/35.20     21.02/21.27     36.50/36.80</p>
<p>BREMEN		34.80/35.20     21.02/21.27     36.50/36.80</p>
<p>DUISBURG	    35.60/35.90     21.51/21.69     36.10/36.40</p>
<p>FRANKFURT	   36.10/36.60     21.81/22.11     37.10/37.40</p>
<p>KARLSRUHE	   36.40/36.80     21.99/22.23     37.00/37.30</p>
<p>INGOLSTADT	  37.70/38.20     22.78/23.08     39.00/39.30</p>
<p>German inland gas oil dipped lower on Monday amid very poor buying interest. Fasching festivities in parts the country were also contributing to slower demand. However, stronger IPE gas oil numbers in the afternoon could tempt buyers back</p>
